# The English translations of the borrowed lines in script_game.rpy.
#
# Copied verbatim from "Miwa no Utsuroi"'s tl/english/script.rpy, ids
# included, and that is the whole point of them: `chap6_83afebf2` was
# computed by Ren'Py, not by us. tltest matches the ids this engine's
# parser derives from the source lines next door against the ids Ren'Py
# derived from the same lines -- so a change to mr_tl_identifier that both
# the parser and a generated catalogue would agree on is still caught
# here. A catalogue we generated ourselves could not do that; it would
# agree with any mistake.
#
# Keep in step with tools/harness/fixgame/script_game.rpy. Twenty lines
# there, twenty blocks here, and tltest asserts exactly that -- every say
# under one of those two labels has to find a translation, and every
# invented line in script.rpy has to miss.

translate english chap0_800d8779:

    # m "La journée de cours est terminée, les devoirs sont faits, je peux enfin me laisser aller."
    m "The school day is over, my homework is done, I can finally let myself relax."

translate english chap0_b681d343:

    # m "Je suis assise dans ma chambre, le vieil instrument de mon père sur les genoux."
    m "I'm sitting in my room, my father's old instrument resting on my lap."

translate english chap0_6b41f567:

    # m "Je joue."
    m "I play."

translate english chap6_9b0ca83c:

    # m "Je ris un peu."
    m "I laugh a little."

translate english chap6_5849b79b:

    # m "\"Merci maman.\""
    m "\"Thanks, Mom.\""

translate english chap6_01cd94cd:

    # m "Je rejoins les autres élèves qui attendent leur tour, tandis que les visiteurs prennent place dans la salle."
    m "I join the other students waiting their turn, while the visitors take their seats in the hall."

translate english chap6_8ba1756b:

    # m "Je pose mon biwa près de moi et regarde la scène."
    m "I set my biwa down beside me and look at the stage."

translate english chap6_94cfe90f:

    # m "Quelques élèves parlent à voix basse."
    m "A few students talk in low voices."

translate english chap6_4668b4ad:

    # m "D'autres vérifient une dernière fois leurs affaires."
    m "Others check their things one last time."

translate english chap6_25e4bc57:

    # m "J'écoute distraitement les prestations qui défilent."
    m "I listen absently to the performances going by."

translate english chap6_81c6148c:

    # m "Une voix annonce la prochaine."
    m "A voice announces the next one."

translate english chap6_e01b506b:

    # m "Je prends mon instrument et serre mon plectre dans ma main."
    m "I pick up my instrument and grip my plectrum in my hand."

translate english chap6_d622af57:

    # m "C'est à moi."
    m "It's my turn."

translate english chap6_b7093e40:

    # m "Je monte sur scène."
    m "I walk out onto the stage."

translate english chap6_c2804616:

    # m "Je regarde les personnes assises dans le public."
    m "I look at the people sitting in the audience."

translate english chap6_0da5b63a:

    # m "Je sais que maman et Soraha sont quelque part devant moi, mais je ne les cherche pas."
    m "I know Mom and Soraha are somewhere out in front of me, but I don't look for them."

translate english chap6_963db9da:

    # m "Je m'assieds sur le tapis rouge et pose mon biwa contre moi."
    m "I sit down on the red mat and rest my biwa against me."

translate english chap6_014c11f3:

    # m "Mon cœur bat beaucoup trop vite, alors je prends une grande inspiration."
    m "My heart is beating far too fast, so I take a deep breath."

translate english chap6_83afebf2:

    # m "Puis une autre."
    m "Then another."

translate english chap6_58309b13:

    # m "Mon ventre se calme légèrement et je laisse maman et Soraha derrière moi puis entre dans l'auditorium."
    m "My stomach settles a bit, and I leave Mom and Soraha behind me then go into the auditorium."
